WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.708
The old castle gates opened slowly.

2
00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:06.330
Everyone stay alert.

3
00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:09.278
You should never have come here.

4
00:00:09.778 --> 00:00:12.801
Wait. Those symbols are not decorative.

5
00:00:13.301 --> 00:00:15.173
What do you mean?

6
00:00:15.673 --> 00:00:17.545
They are a warning.
